# Lotto Chances — Project brain

**Obsidian vault:** `%USERPROFILE%\OneDrive\Documents\ObsidianVaults\Lotto-Chances\Lotto-Chances`

After meaningful work:

1. Update `90 Changelog.md` in the vault (or delegate `@cp1-documenter`).
2. Log bugs in `80 Error collection.md`.
3. File Research in `70 Documentation/Research/`, Critic reviews in `70 Documentation/Reviews/`.

**Agents:** See `AGENTS.md` and vault `30 Agents.md`. Use skills `@cp1-research`, `@cp1-coder`, `@cp1-critic`, `@cp1-documenter`, `@cp1-tester`, `@cp1-architect`.

**Project Leader** orchestrates; prefer dedicated agent skills over doing everything in one chat.

**Model efficiency:** For small/uncomplicated tasks, use lighter/cheaper/faster models to minimize token usage. Reserve strong/thinking models for architecture, security, unclear bugs, and deep research. See vault `30 Agents/Model efficiency.md`. Task briefs should set `Model tier: light | standard | heavy`.

**Lotto app:** Statistics only — never imply past draws predict future wins. Include disclaimer in user-facing output.

**Sister product:** Ko-Stream has a separate vault (`ObsidianVaults\Ko-Stream\Ko-Stream`) — do not mix docs.
